<div class="page-header"><h1>Become a Kitchen Cabinet Dealer in California</h1><p>Pinnacle Sales is the manufacturer's representative for Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Pronorm German Kitchens, and Vistora Closets across California — recruiting and supporting kitchen & bath dealers from the Bay Area to Los Angeles, Orange County, and San Diego, backed by 23+ years of in-market experience.</p></div>
