<Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />

<h2 id="why-partner-with-pinnacle">Why Partner With Pinnacle Sales in California</h2>
<p>If you run a kitchen & bath showroom or design studio in California, Pinnacle Sales gives you a portfolio that spans every market tier — from semi-custom value for builder and ADU work to handleless German luxury for the high-end coastal and hillside enclaves. California is several markets in one: Northern California leans clean and contemporary, Southern California spans transitional coastal to sleek modern, and the premium coastal markets drive demand for European handleless kitchens. You get protected territory, in-person line training, design and quoting support, and showroom merchandising backed by 23+ years of dealer relationships.</p>

<h2 id="lines-you-can-carry">Premium Lines You Can Carry in California</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry/">Shiloh Cabinetry</a></strong> — Custom paint, inset, and wide wood species; the versatile choice for California's transitional and coastal kitchens, with strong dealer margins.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">Eclipse Cabinetry</a></strong> — Frameless, full-access modern construction — a strong fit for contemporary Bay Area and LA remodels.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry/">Aspect Cabinetry</a></strong> — Value semi-custom built for builder and ADU projects across the state.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens/">Pronorm German Kitchens</a></strong> — Handleless, precision-engineered European fronts for high-end coastal and hillside homes, with protected dealer territory.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/vistora-closets/">Vistora Closets</a></strong> — Made-to-order closets and storage to grow whole-home revenue.</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="california-market-opportunity">The California Market Opportunity</h2>
<p>Northern California favors clean, contemporary kitchens — frameless construction, flat-panel and slab fronts, warm woods against white and gray. Southern California ranges from breezy transitional in the coastal communities to crisp modern in the hills, with two-tone schemes and walnut or white-oak islands. Across the premium coastal and hillside markets — Marin, the Peninsula, the Westside, Newport Coast — handleless <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens/">Pronorm</a> and <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">frameless Eclipse</a> kitchens continue to gain share — a high-margin opportunity for dealers carrying the European and full-access lines that fit California's contemporary and coastal architecture.</p>

